      "releases": {
        "1.4.0": {
          "id": "@tennis-hq/ssot@1.4.0",
          "name": "@tennis-hq/ssot",
          "version": "1.4.0",
          "type": "library",
          "description": "Tennis HQ governance SSOT (npm: @tennis-hq/ssot) — color registry + glossary color wire",
          "author": {
            "name": "FactoryWager Team",
            "email": "team@factory-wager.com",
            "url": "https://factory-wager.com"
          },
          "tags": [],
          "readme": "# `@tennis-hq/ssot`\n\n**Publish-only** package for Tennis HQ governance artifacts (MIT).\n\nThe root app (`tennis-hq`) stays **`private: true`** and is never published.\n\n| Export | Contents |\n|--------|----------|\n| `@tennis-hq/ssot` | `SSOT_VERSION`, `COLOR_KEYS`, loaders |\n| `@tennis-hq/ssot/color-system.json` | Kernel color registry |\n| `@tennis-hq/ssot/glossary-colors.json` | Glossary color wire |\n\n## From monorepo root\n\n```bash\nbun run colors:build\nbun run ssot:build\nbun run ssot:check\nbun run ssot:pack          # artifacts/publish/*.tgz — no auth\nbun run ssot:publish       # needs NPM_TOKEN or npm login\n```\n\n## Version\n\n```bash\nbun pm version patch --no-git-tag-version   # root\nbun run ssot:build                          # sync + artifacts\n```\n\n## Config\n\n- `publishConfig.access`: **public** (free scoped package)\n- `private`: false\n- `files`: dist, registry, README, LICENSE\n",
          "publishedAt": "2026-07-31T15:01:23.230Z",
          "publisher": "tennis-hq",
          "storage": {
